<title>LEO Cybersecurity & AI | 守护 AI 时代的数字安全</title>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar dark"><div class="container nav"><a class="logo" href="#home">LEO<small>CYBERSECURITY & AI</small></a><nav class="links" id="navlinks"><a href="#home" data-zh="首页" data-en="Home">首页</a><a href="#about" data-zh="关于LEO" data-en="About LEO">关于LEO</a><a href="#services" data-zh="专业服务" data-en="Services">专业服务</a><a href="#training" data-zh="培训课程" data-en="Training">培训课程</a><a href="#insights" data-zh="专业洞察" data-en="Insights">专业洞察</a><a href="#contact" data-zh="联系咨询" data-en="Contact">联系咨询</a></nav><div class="navright"><button class="lang" id="lang" type="button" aria-label="Switch language">EN</button><a class="btn primary nav-cta" href="#contact" data-zh="预约咨询 →" data-en="Consultation →">预约咨询 →</a><button class="menu" id="menu" type="button" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button></div></div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero dark" id="home"><div class="container"><div class="hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">CYBERSECURITY × AI SECURITY</div><h1 data-zh="守护AI时代的|数字安全" data-en="Securing the AI Era|Digital Trust">守护AI时代的<br /><span>数字安全</span></h1><p data-zh="以网络安全与AI安全的融合视角，为企业提供专业培训、风险治理咨询与切实可行的能力建设方案。" data-en="Cybersecurity and AI security training, risk advisory, and practical capability-building for organizations.">以网络安全与AI安全的融合视角，为企业提供专业培训、风险治理咨询与切实可行的能力建设方案。</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#contact" data-zh="预约专业咨询 ↗" data-en="Explore Consultation ↗">预约专业咨询 ↗</a><a class="btn outline" href="#services" data-zh="探索专业服务 →" data-en="Explore Services →">探索专业服务 →</a></div></div><svg class="hero-art" viewBox="0 0 560 500" role="img" aria-label="Abstract AI cybersecurity network illustration"><defs><radialGradient id="glow"><stop stop-color="#49a4ff" stop-opacity=".38"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#49a4ff" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient><linearGradient id="line"><stop stop-color="#73c3ff" stop-opacity=".15"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#8cd6ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#3b6be5" stop-opacity=".25"/></linearGradient></defs><circle cx="280" cy="250" r="225" fill="url(#glow)"/><g fill="none" stroke="url(#line)"><circle cx="280" cy="250" r="170" opacity=".55"/><circle cx="280" cy="250" r="125" stroke-width="1.5" opacity=".7"/><circle cx="280" cy="250" r="79" stroke-width="2"/><ellipse cx="280" cy="250" rx="215" ry="82" transform="rotate(-29 280 250)" opacity=".5"/><ellipse cx="280" cy="250" rx="215" ry="82" transform="rotate(45 280 250)" opacity=".5"/><path d="M60 220 140 140 245 175 350 100 460 175 505 290 405 390 280 330 170 420 80 330Z" opacity=".7"/><path d="M140 140 280 250 350 100M245 175 405 390 460 175M80 330 280 250 505 290M170 420 280 250 460 175" opacity=".7"/></g><g fill="#8ed1ff"><circle cx="60" cy="220" r="5"/><circle cx="140" cy="140" r="6"/><circle cx="245" cy="175" r="4"/><circle cx="350" cy="100" r="5"/><circle cx="460" cy="175" r="7"/><circle cx="505" cy="290" r="4"/><circle cx="405" cy="390" r="6"/><circle cx="280" cy="330" r="4"/><circle cx="170" cy="420" r="5"/><circle cx="80" cy="330" r="4"/></g><path d="M280 180 345 207v52c0 50-31 83-65 102-34-19-65-52-65-102v-52Z" fill="#0d3159" stroke="#88d2ff" stroke-width="3"/><path d="m250 263 22 22 41-49" fill="none" stroke="#9bdeff" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="7"/></svg></div><div class="hero-notes"><span>AI SECURITY</span><span>CYBER RESILIENCE</span><span>PROFESSIONAL TRAINING</span><span>RISK ADVISORY</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="about"><div class="container about"><div class="portrait"><strong>LEO</strong><small data-zh="个人职业照片预留区域" data-en="Professional photo placeholder">个人职业照片预留区域</small></div><div><div class="kicker">ABOUT LEO</div><h2 data-zh="连接网络安全与人工智能安全" data-en="Connecting Cybersecurity and AI Security">连接网络安全与人工智能安全</h2><p class="lead" data-zh="LEO专注于网络安全、AI安全与组织能力建设的交叉领域，致力于帮助企业理解新兴技术风险、建立安全实践，并以更负责任的方式采用人工智能。" data-en="LEO focuses on cybersecurity, AI security and organizational capabilities, helping teams understand emerging risks and adopt AI responsibly.">LEO专注于网络安全、AI安全与组织能力建设的交叉领域，致力于帮助企业理解新兴技术风险、建立安全实践，并以更负责任的方式采用人工智能。</p><p data-zh="个人经历、认证和专业项目仅在核实后展示；本站不使用未经确认的资历或客户案例。" data-en="Personal credentials and project experience will only be published once verified. No fabricated qualifications or client cases.">个人经历、认证和专业项目仅在核实后展示；本站不使用未经确认的资历或客户案例。</p><div class="chips"><span class="chip">Cybersecurity</span><span class="chip">AI Security</span><span class="chip">Training</span><span class="chip">Risk Governance</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section alt" id="services"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">WHAT I DO</div><h2 data-zh="专业服务" data-en="Professional Services">专业服务</h2><p class="lead" data-zh="从安全能力建设到AI风险治理，围绕企业真实业务需求设计可落地的培训与咨询方案。" data-en="Practical training and advisory aligned to real business needs, from security capability-building to AI risk governance.">从安全能力建设到AI风险治理，围绕企业真实业务需求设计可落地的培训与咨询方案。</p><div class="cards">
<article class="card"><div class="number">01 / CYBERSECURITY</div><h3 data-zh="网络安全专业培训" data-en="Cybersecurity Training">网络安全专业培训</h3><p data-zh="面向技术团队、企业员工和管理者，提升网络安全意识、风险识别与实践能力。" data-en="Build security awareness, risk recognition and practical capabilities across teams.">面向技术团队、企业员工和管理者，提升网络安全意识、风险识别与实践能力。</p><ul><li data-zh="安全意识与威胁识别" data-en="Awareness and threat recognition">安全意识与威胁识别</li><li data-zh="云安全与身份访问管理" data-en="Cloud security and identity access">云安全与身份访问管理</li><li data-zh="安全事件响应与治理" data-en="Incident response and governance">安全事件响应与治理</li></ul><a href="#contact" data-zh="了解合作方式 →" data-en="Discuss Your Needs →">了解合作方式 →</a></article>
<article class="card"><div class="number">02 / AI SECURITY</div><h3 data-zh="AI安全与风险治理咨询" data-en="AI Security & Risk Advisory">AI安全与风险治理咨询</h3><p data-zh="协助组织识别生成式AI与模型应用风险，讨论AI安全政策和治理改进路线图。" data-en="Identify generative AI risks and discuss security controls and governance priorities.">协助组织识别生成式AI与模型应用风险，讨论AI安全政策和治理改进路线图。</p><ul><li data-zh="AI应用风险评估" data-en="AI application risk assessment">AI应用风险评估</li><li data-zh="LLM应用安全与防护" data-en="LLM application security">LLM应用安全与防护</li><li data-zh="AI治理政策与路线图" data-en="AI governance and roadmap">AI治理政策与路线图</li></ul><a href="#contact" data-zh="了解合作方式 →" data-en="Discuss Your Needs →">了解合作方式 →</a></article>
<article class="card"><div class="number">03 / AI ENABLEMENT</div><h3 data-zh="企业AI应用与安全培训" data-en="Enterprise AI Enablement">企业AI应用与安全培训</h3><p data-zh="帮助业务与技术团队在保护数据、管理风险的前提下有效使用生成式AI。" data-en="Help business and technical teams use generative AI with appropriate data safeguards.">帮助业务与技术团队在保护数据、管理风险的前提下有效使用生成式AI。</p><ul><li data-zh="生成式AI基础与场景" data-en="Generative AI fundamentals">生成式AI基础与场景</li><li data-zh="AI工作流与效率提升" data-en="AI workflows and productivity">AI工作流与效率提升</li><li data-zh="安全使用与数据保护" data-en="Safe use and data protection">安全使用与数据保护</li></ul><a href="#contact" data-zh="了解合作方式 →" data-en="Discuss Your Needs →">了解合作方式 →</a></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="training"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">TRAINING PROGRAMS</div><h2 data-zh="精选培训项目" data-en="Featured Training Programs">精选培训项目</h2><p class="lead" data-zh="课程方向可按行业、岗位、培训语言和交付形式进行定制；具体时长与安排待确认。" data-en="Illustrative courses tailored by industry, role, language and delivery format; durations are subject to agreement.">课程方向可按行业、岗位、培训语言和交付形式进行定制；具体时长与安排待确认。</p><div class="course-grid"><div class="course"><div class="meta">PROPOSED PROGRAM</div><h3>AI Security Essentials</h3><p data-zh="面向管理层与IT团队，理解AI系统常见安全风险、责任边界与基本控制措施。" data-en="Understand common AI security risks, accountability and foundational controls.">面向管理层与IT团队，理解AI系统常见安全风险、责任边界与基本控制措施。</p><a href="#contact" data-zh="咨询课程 →" data-en="Discuss Training →">咨询课程 →</a></div><div class="course"><div class="meta">PROPOSED PROGRAM</div><h3>Secure Generative AI in Business</h3><p data-zh="面向企业员工和业务团队，学习生成式AI的安全使用、数据保护与实践方法。" data-en="Safe generative AI use, data protection and practical workplace approaches.">面向企业员工和业务团队，学习生成式AI的安全使用、数据保护与实践方法。</p><a href="#contact" data-zh="咨询课程 →" data-en="Discuss Training →">咨询课程 →</a></div><div class="course"><div class="meta">PROPOSED WORKSHOP</div><h3>Cybersecurity & AI Risk Workshop</h3><p data-zh="面向IT、安全和治理团队，开展网络安全与AI风险融合场景的实务研讨。" data-en="A practical workshop on the intersection of cybersecurity and AI risk.">面向IT、安全和治理团队，开展网络安全与AI风险融合场景的实务研讨。</p><a href="#contact" data-zh="咨询课程 →" data-en="Discuss Training →">咨询课程 →</a></div></div><p class="notice" data-zh="课程时长与内容为建议方案，实际交付范围将在需求沟通后确认。" data-en="Course content and duration are illustrative and subject to agreement.">课程时长与内容为建议方案，实际交付范围将在需求沟通后确认。</p></div></section>
<section class="section alt" id="insights"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">INSIGHTS & RESOURCES</div><h2 data-zh="专业洞察与资源" data-en="Insights & Resources">专业洞察与资源</h2><p class="lead" data-zh="以清晰、实用的内容讨论AI安全、网络安全治理与企业实践。博客原文保持不变。" data-en="Practical perspectives on AI security, cyber governance and enterprise practice. Existing blog articles are preserved.">以清晰、实用的内容讨论AI安全、网络安全治理与企业实践。博客原文保持不变。</p><div class="article-grid">{posts.map((p,i)=><a class="article" href={getPermalink(p.permalink,'post')}><div class="visual">{['◎','⌘','◇'][i]}</div><div class="content"><small>LEO / INSIGHTS</small><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.excerpt}</p><div class="tag">{p.publishDate.toISOString().slice(0,10)} ↗</div></div></a>)}</div><div class="actions"><a class="btn article-more" href="/blog" data-zh="阅读全部博客文章 →" data-en="Read All Articles →">阅读全部博客文章 →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section contact" id="contact"><div class="container contact-grid"><div><div class="kicker">LET'S CONNECT</div><h2 data-zh="一起构建更安全的AI未来" data-en="Building a More Secure AI Future">一起构建更安全的AI未来</h2><p data-zh="正在规划企业安全培训、AI安全评估或定制咨询项目？可以先了解服务方向与合作边界。" data-en="Exploring security training, AI risk assessment or advisory? Start with our services and working boundaries.">正在规划企业安全培训、AI安全评估或定制咨询项目？可以先了解服务方向与合作边界。</p><p data-zh="正式咨询渠道尚未开放。请勿通过公开渠道发送项目资料、密码、密钥或敏感信息。" data-en="An official inquiry channel is not yet available. Do not send project files, passwords, keys or sensitive information through public channels.">正式咨询渠道尚未开放。请勿通过公开渠道发送项目资料、密码、密钥或敏感信息。</p></div><form class="form" id="contactForm"><h3 data-zh="项目需求咨询" data-en="Project Inquiry">项目需求咨询</h3><label for="name" data-zh="姓名 / 称呼" data-en="Name">姓名 / 称呼</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="Leo / 张先生" /><label for="email" data-zh="工作邮箱" data-en="Work Email">工作邮箱</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="name@company.com" /><label for="service" data-zh="感兴趣的服务" data-en="Interested Service">感兴趣的服务</label><select id="service" name="service"><option value="AI Security Advisory" data-zh="AI安全咨询" data-en="AI Security Advisory">AI安全咨询</option><option value="Cybersecurity Training" data-zh="网络安全培训" data-en="Cybersecurity Training">网络安全培训</option><option value="AI Training" data-zh="企业AI培训" data-en="Enterprise AI Training">企业AI培训</option><option value="Other" data-zh="其他需求" data-en="Other">其他需求</option></select><label for="message" data-zh="需求简述" data-en="Project Brief">需求简述</label><textarea id="message" name="message" required placeholder="请简要说明团队规模、目标与期望时间"></textarea><button class="btn primary" type="submit" data-zh="复制咨询内容 →" data-en="Copy Inquiry Details →">复制咨询内容 →</button><div class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><p class="fine" data-zh="演示模式：仅复制内容，不会提交、发送或存储任何信息。" data-en="Demo only: copies details without submitting, sending or storing data.">演示模式：仅复制内容，不会提交、发送或存储任何信息。</p></form></div></section>
</main><footer class="footer"><div class="container foot"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} LEO Cybersecurity & AI. All rights reserved.</span><span data-zh="个人品牌网站 · 服务范围以正式协议为准" data-en="Personal brand website · Services subject to agreement">个人品牌网站 · 服务范围以正式协议为准</span></div></footer>
<script is:inline>
(function(){
 const langBtn=document.getElementById('lang'),menu=document.getElementById('menu'),links=document.getElementById('navlinks');
 function apply(lang){document.documentElement.lang=lang==='en'?'en':'zh-CN';document.querySelectorAll('[data-zh][data-en]').forEach(el=>{const v=el.dataset[lang];if(el.tagName==='H1'&&v.includes('|')){const parts=v.split('|');el.replaceChildren(document.createTextNode(parts[0]),document.createElement('br'));const s=document.createElement('span');s.textContent=parts[1];el.append(s);}else el.textContent=v;});langBtn.textContent=lang==='en'?'中文':'EN';langBtn.dataset.active=lang;}
 langBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{const next=langBtn.dataset.active==='en'?'zh':'en';try{localStorage.setItem('leo-language',next);}catch{}apply(next);});
 menu.addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=links.classList.toggle('open');menu.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));});
 links.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a=>a.addEventListener('click',()=>{links.classList.remove('open');menu.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');}));
 const form=document.getElementById('contactForm');form.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const parts=['Name: '+form.elements.namedItem('name').value,'Email: '+form.elements.namedItem('email').value,'Service: '+form.elements.namedItem('service').value,'Message: '+form.elements.namedItem('message').value];const data=parts.join('\\n');const status=document.getElementById('status');try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(data);status.textContent=langBtn.dataset.active==='en'?'Copied. No information was submitted.':'已复制。未提交或发送任何信息。';}catch{status.textContent=langBtn.dataset.active==='en'?'Copy unavailable; no data was sent.':'复制不可用；未发送任何数据。';}});let saved='zh';try{saved=localStorage.getItem('leo-language')||'zh';}catch{}apply(saved);
})();
</script>
<style is:global>
:root{--navy:#0b1526;--navy2:#112947;--blue:#3979e5;--light:#f5f7fb;--ink:#142238;--muted:#607087;--border:#dfe6ef;--white:#fff}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,"Noto Sans SC","Microsoft YaHei",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.7}a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.container{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 44px));margin:auto}.dark{color:white;background:var(--navy)}.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:rgba(11,21,38,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff1c}.nav{height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;justify-content:space-between}.logo{font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.07em;font-size:26px;line-height:1}.logo small{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#a6b9d0;margin-top:7px}.links{display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:center}.links a{font-size:13px;color:#c7d6e9}.links a:hover{color:white}.navright{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.lang{background:transparent;color:#dce8f6;border:1px solid #53647a;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px}.btn{border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:13px 21px;font-weight:700;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;transition:.2s}.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}.primary{background:var(--blue);color:white}.outline{border:1px solid #8193ad;color:white;background:transparent}.menu{display:none;background:transparent;color:white;border:1px solid #66768b;border-radius:8px;padding:7px 12px}.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:90px 0 94px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 45%,#173e70 0%,#0b1526 56%)}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;align-items:center;gap:40px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7eb6ff;font-weight:800}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(36px,4.7vw,66px);line-height:1.18;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:22px 0}.hero h1 span{color:#80b5ff}.hero p{max-width:590px;color:#c0cfe2;font-size:17px}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:30px}.hero-art{width:100%;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 35px #2872d350)}.hero-notes{margin-top:62px;border-top:1px solid #ffffff35;padding-top:22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;color:#9fb5cf;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em}.section{padding:92px 0}.section.alt{background:var(--light)}.kicker{font-size:12px;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.section h2{font-size:clamp(29px,3vw,43px);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:12px 0 18px}.lead{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);max-width:750px}.about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}.portrait{min-height:330px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0c2444,#214b7e);border-radius:20px;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.portrait:before{content:"";width:230px;height:230px;border:1px solid #72b3ff55;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 45px #72b3ff12,0 0 0 90px #72b3ff0b}.portrait strong{position:absolute;color:#c9e2ff;font-size:40px;letter-spacing:.2em}.portrait small{position:absolute;bottom:25px;color:#9fbfdf;font-size:12px}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:23px}.chip{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:100px;padding:7px 13px;color:#53657c;font-size:12px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:38px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:17px;padding:30px;box-shadow:0 9px 30px #13253a08;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.card .number{font-size:12px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:800}.card h3{font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;margin:18px 0 12px}.card p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);flex:1}.card ul{padding-left:19px;color:#46566b;font-size:13px}.card a,.course a{font-size:13px;color:#2366c8;font-weight:800;margin-top:12px}.course-grid,.article-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:35px}.course{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;background:white}.course .meta{font-size:12px;color:#4976b7}.course h3{line-height:1.35;font-size:19px}.course p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.article{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:white}.article .visual{height:145px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 60% 50%,#398be488,#122b4b 50%,#091729);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#8bc2ff;font-size:45px}.article .content{padding:22px}.article .content small{color:var(--blue);font-weight:700}.article h3{line-height:1.4;font-size:17px;margin:12px 0}.article p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.article .tag{font-size:11px;color:#8b98a8}.article-more{background:#fff;color:#2366c8;border:1px solid #cad8ea}.contact{background:#102746;color:white}.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;align-items:start}.contact p{color:#b8cbe2}.form{background:white;color:var(--ink);padding:30px;border-radius:18px}.form h3{margin:0 0 20px}.form label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:12px 0 6px}.form input,.form select,.form textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid #cdd7e4;border-radius:8px;padding:11px 12px;background:#fff;color:#142238;font:inherit}.form textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:100px}.form button{width:100%;margin-top:18px}.form .status{margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:#1f6d45}.form p{color:#52657c}.form .fine{font-size:12px;color:#6e7d90}.form .btn{margin-top:20px}.footer{background:#091321;color:#aabbd0;padding:34px 0;font-size:12px}.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.notice{border-left:3px solid #3979e5;padding-left:16px;color:#61758b;font-size:13px;margin-top:20px}@media(max-width:860px){.links{display:none;position:absolute;top:76px;left:0;right:0;background:#0b1526;padding:20px 25px;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;border-top:1px solid #33445a}.links.open{display:flex}.menu{display:block}.nav-cta{display:none}.hero-grid,.about,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-art{max-width:490px;margin:auto}.cards,.course-grid,.article-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.hero{padding-top:65px}.about{gap:30px}}@media(max-width:600px){.container{width:min(100% - 32px,1120px)}.section{padding:65px 0}.cards,.course-grid,.article-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:39px}.hero-notes{flex-wrap:wrap}.nav{height:68px}.links{top:68px}.hero{padding-bottom:55px}.contact-grid{gap:30px}}
